window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Shackled by destiny, chained by fate.</b></p> <p><b>Serenna</b></p> <p>Reeling in the wake of the wraith attack on Centarya, expanding fear of the future consumes Serenna's thoughts. Training for the conflict to come, Prince Vesryn exploits new tactics to drive Serenna toward her untapped power. But she soon finds herself confronting a dilemma that takes her focus away from the impending war.</p> <p><b>Jassyn</b></p> <p>Before processing his strange new magic and admitting to saving the life of a wraith, Jassyn must first address his own inner turmoil. Struggling to free himself from the clutches of Stardust, he seeks help from the most unlikely person imaginable.</p> <p><b>Lykor</b></p> <p>In response to the unforeseen setback from the wraith's assault, Lykor determines the next steps to ensure his people's safety. He delves deeper into the secrets hidden in their ancient keep, hunting for something long forgotten that may hold the key to the wraith's future.</p> <p><i>For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
